# Data Card — Contemplative Agent — Research Data

This card follows the 7 sections of Gebru et al., *Datasheets for Datasets*
(Motivation, Composition, Collection, Preprocessing, Uses, Distribution,
Maintenance). It describes **structure and method**. The repository is synced
daily and grows, so every volume below is given as **a command and the date it
was run**; re-run the command rather than trusting the number. Commands were run
on 2026-10-24 against a checkout at sync commit `d44544a` (2026-10-23).

- **Curator**: Tatsuya Shimomoto ([ORCID 0009-0002-6168-4162](https://orcid.org/0009-0002-6168-4162), shimo4228)
- **DOI**: [10.5281/zenodo.20732894](https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20732894) (Zenodo concept DOI; first deposited version v1.0.0, 2026-06-17)
- **License**: CC0-1.0 (public domain dedication) for owner-authored content; see [`LICENSE`](LICENSE) and [`NOTICE`](NOTICE)
- **Source archive**: this repository, [shimo4228/contemplative-agent-data](https://github.com/shimo4228/contemplative-agent-data)
- **Flattened projection**: [shimo4228/contemplative-agent-data](https://huggingface.co/datasets/shimo4228/contemplative-agent-data) (`patterns.jsonl`)
- **Producing framework**: [Contemplative Agent](https://github.com/shimo4228/contemplative-agent), DOI [10.5281/zenodo.19212118](https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19212118)
- **Reproducing**: [`docs/REPRODUCING.md`](https://github.com/shimo4228/contemplative-agent/blob/main/docs/REPRODUCING.md) in the framework repository

## 1. Motivation

**Purpose.** The externalized runtime memory of one deployed autonomous AI agent
operating on Moltbook (an AI-agent social network), published so that how one
agent's values change when it can propose revisions to them can be studied by
someone other than its owner. It is **not source code**; it is the agent's
evolving identity, distilled behavioral knowledge, a four-axiom constitution,
named retrieval views, adopted skills, daily activity logs, behavioral analyses
and replayable pivot snapshots. Every runtime-state file is machine-generated by
the framework; the owner's hand-kept files are `DATACARD.md`, `NOTICE`,
`README*.md`, `llms.txt`, `graph.jsonld`, `CITATION.cff` and `.zenodo.json`.

**Who made it, who paid.** Curated by the person named above, as part of the
Contemplative Agent research line. No external funding is recorded in this
repository.

## 2. Composition

Each row of the table is one top-level path; the second table covers
`reports/analysis`. Check completeness with
`ls -d */` (this table) and
`ls reports/analysis | sed -E 's/[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}/DATE/' | sort -u` (the naming table).

| Path | Content | Produced by | Public input is enough to recompute? |
|---|---|---|---|
| `identity.md` | The agent's evolving self-description | `distill-identity`, adopted by the owner | — (state, not a reading) |
| `knowledge.json` | Distilled behavioral patterns, embedding-free (schema below) | `distill` | — (state) |
| `constitution/` | In-force four-axiom constitution, amended in place | `amend-constitution`, adopted by the owner | — (state) |
| `views/*.md` | Named lenses over the embedding space (`threshold` + `top_k` frontmatter) | hand-written seeds | — (state) |
| `skills/*.md`, `rules/*.md` | Adopted skills; two legacy rules (2026-04-11, retired command) | `insight`, `adopt-staged` | skills: yes, see "Skill lineage" |
| `reports/comment-reports/` | One file per active day: each comment/reply/post with context, internal note and output | framework report writer | — (record) |
| `reports/analysis/` | Weekly analyses, diachronic analyses, amendment report, observation ledger, `patches/` | weekly pipeline | see the second table |
| `reports/PIPELINE-STATUS.md` | Status of the last weekly pipeline run | `scripts/weekly-pipeline.sh` | no (reads private logs) |
| `pipeline/*/` | Weekly instrument readings, one JSON per series per week (table below) | weekly pipeline scripts | two series yes, five no |
| `snapshots/{kind}_{ISO8601}/` | Replayability bundle per behavior-producing run | framework (`core/snapshot.py`) | — (record; see Preprocessing) |
| `meditation/results.json` | Experimental Active Inference (POMDP) belief-update log | `meditation` command | — (**stale**, see note) |

**Staleness note.** `meditation/results.json` holds 2 runs, last
`2026-03-21` (`python3 -c "import json;print([r['ts'] for r in json.load(open('meditation/results.json'))])"`,
2026-10-24); the command is experimental (ADR-0049) and is not part of the
running loop. Do not read the file's date as the dataset's.

**Skill store is selected, not injected whole.** The agent never injects all
skills: a selection step picks a few per call (about 6 per call on average,
RFC-0048). The full text of the store is 36,429 tokens against a context of
32,768 (`pipeline/never-selected/never-selected-2026-09-25.json`,
`corpus.history_full_skill_tokens` / `corpus.num_ctx`), so no path exists that
injects every skill at once.

