| `weekly-DATE.md` / `weekly-DATE.ja.md` | Weekly rolling analysis (EN / JA) |
| `weekly-DATE-findings.md` / `.ja.md` | Findings of the weekly report |
| `weekly-DATE-packet.md` | Decision packet the weekly gate read (retired format, kept as history) |
| `weekly-DATE-insight-review.md` | Review of that week's staged skill candidates |
| `weekly-DATE-archive-candidates.txt` | Skills proposed for retirement that week |
| `weekly-DATE-improvement.md` | Improvement proposal text |
